: Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/chat/subresources/completions/methods/create (stream_options.include_usage)
: Read 2026-11-07. The doc: with include_usage an additional chunk is streamed before data: [DONE], its usage covers the
: entire request and its choices is always an empty array; all other chunks carry "usage": null. The token figures
: below are illustrative; the field names are the documented usage object (prompt_tokens, completion_tokens,
: prompt_tokens_details.cached_tokens, completion_tokens_details.reasoning_tokens).
